<title>JAPAN: Matsuka - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Matsuka - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		824 million	 vs	  547 million</p>
<p> Operating	   31 million	 vs	   22 million</p>
<p> Current	     26 million	 vs	   17 million</p>
<p> Net		   14 million	 vs	   22 million</p>
<p> EPS		    1.45 yen	  vs	    2.17 yen</p>
<p> Shares		10 million	 vs	   10 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Matsuka Co Ltd is a yarn-spinning company.</p>
